msgid "Usage: click [OPTION]... [BUTTONS]...\nClick mouse buttons.\n\nOptions:\n  -r, --repeat=N             Repeat entire sequence N times\n  -D, --next-delay=N         Delay N milliseconds between input events (up/down,                                a complete click means doubled time)\n  -P, --press-release        Press & release mouse button to complete a click, (optional)\n  -h, --help                 Display this help and exit\n\nHow to specify buttons:\n  Now all mouse buttons are represented using hexadecimal numeric values, with an optional\nbit mask to specify if mouse up/down needs to be omitted.\n  0x00 - LEFT\n  0x01 - RIGHT\n  0x02 - MIDDLE\n  0x03 - SIDE\n  0x04 - EXTR\n  0x05 - FORWARD\n  0x06 - BACK\n  0x07 - TASK\n  0x40 - Mouse down\n  0x80 - Mouse up\n  Examples:\n    0x00: chooses left button, but does nothing (you can use this to implement extra sleeps)\n    0xC0: left button click (down then up)\n    0x41: right button down\n    0x82: middle button up\n  The '0x' prefix can be omitted if you want.\n"
msgstr "Geavaheapmi: click [OPTION]... [BUTTONS]...\nDeaddil sáhpána boalu.\n\nMolssaeavttut:\n  -r, --repeat=N             Gearddut olles ráiddu N geardde\n  -D, --next-delay=N         Maŋidit N millisekundda dáhpáhusaid gaskkas (vuolá/čuožžu,                                ollislaš deaddin mearkkaša guovttegeardde áiggi)\n  -P, --press-release        Deaddil ja luoitte sáhpána boalu ollislaš deaddima várás (eavttolaš)\n  -h, --help                 Čájet dán veahki ja heaittit\n\nBoaluid meroštallan:\n  Dál buot sáhpánboalut leat ovdanbuktojuvvon heksadesimála lohkomihtuiguin, eavttolaš\nbitmaskain mii meroštallá sáhttá go sáhpánboalu vuolá/čuožžu dáhpáhus guođđojuvvot eret.\n  0x00 - LEFT\n  0x01 - RIGHT\n  0x02 - MIDDLE\n  0x03 - SIDE\n  0x04 - EXTR\n  0x05 - FORWARD\n  0x06 - BACK\n  0x07 - TASK\n  0x40 - Sáhpána vuoládeapmi\n  0x80 - Sáhpána luoitin\n  Ovdamearkkat:\n    0x00: vállje gurut boalu, muhto ii daga maidege (dáinna sáhtát lasihit eará vuorddáhusaid)\n    0xC0: gurut boalu deaddin (vuolá ja luoitá)\n    0x41: olgeš boalu vuoládeapmi\n    0x82: gaskaboalu luoitin\n  '0x'-álgu sáhttá guođđit eret jus háliidat.\n"

#, c-format
msgid "option %s"
msgstr "molssaeaktu %s"

#, c-format
msgid " with arg %s"
msgstr " árgumeanttain %s"

